# The organisation's convention: every dot-named path and every Markdown file is local, and what
# the repository ships is named back.
.*
*.md
!.github/
!.gitignore
!.editorconfig
!.shellcheckrc
!README.md
# A project's cargo configuration, as the template gives it.
!template/.cargo/
# The documents a project takes from the template.
!template/*.md
